G0 Z0.000 F3000 ; pen down
G1 X178.000 Y102.000 F1500
G0 Z3.000 F3000 ; pen up

; === FOOTER ===
G0 Z8.000 F3000 ; raise pen safely
G0 X40.000 Y40.000 F3000 ; return to origin
M84 ; disable steppers
